            },
            "text": "When you meet a guest face to face, they read your body language and hear your tone before they fully take in your words, so a warm welcome is built from far more than sentences. Three things make a strong first impression, and they cost nothing:",
            "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
            "id": "1a5e2001-154c-5dd2-875a-9e077363e3e0",
            "language": "en",
            "order": 4,
            "provenance_kind": "source_verbatim",
            "runs": [
                {
                    "bold": false,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": "A genuine smile and friendly eye contact. They quietly say “you are welcome here” before you speak a word.",
                    "underline": false
